    (1, 'Rishmora StudioTone ANC 01 Wireless Headphones', 'Wireless Headphones', 2499.00, 'Comfort-focused wireless headphones for work, travel, and everyday listening.', 'Rishmora StudioTone ANC 01 Wireless Headphones. Designed for extended listening, these wireless headphones combine cushioned over-ear comfort with clear everyday audio. The adjustable headband and foldable design make them easy to wear at home or carry while travelling. Use the onboard controls for convenient playback and calls. Actual battery life and audio performance depend on volume, device, and usage.' || chr(10) || chr(10) || 'Product care: Wipe clean with a soft dry cloth unless the product packaging gives different instructions. Keep the product away from liquids and extreme heat where applicable. Package contents and specifications should be confirmed against the item listing before purchase.', 'Soft over-ear cushions for long listening sessions (01)', 'Foldable design for convenient storage and travel (01)', 'Built-in controls for calls and music (01)'),
